## Interface: 11200
## Title: Modern Spellbook Enhanced
## Notes: Changes the spellbook to a more modern look inspired by the retail version. Requires ClassicAPI.
## Notes-deDE: Gibt dem Zauberbuch ein modernes Aussehen nach dem Vorbild der Retail-Version. Benötigt ClassicAPI.
## Notes-esES: Da al libro de hechizos un aspecto más moderno, inspirado en la versión retail. Requiere ClassicAPI.
## Notes-frFR: Donne au grimoire un aspect plus moderne, inspiré de la version retail. Nécessite ClassicAPI.
## Notes-koKR: 마법책을 최신 버전에서 영감을 받은 현대적인 모습으로 바꿉니다. ClassicAPI가 필요합니다.
## Notes-zhCN: 将法术书改为受正式服启发的现代外观。需要 ClassicAPI。
## Notes-zhTW: 將法術書改為受正式服啟發的現代外觀。需要 ClassicAPI。
## Author: Original addon: vegeta1k95; Enhanced version: Drakensangs
## Version: 1.1
## OptionalDeps: Clique

## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ModernSpellBook_DB

# Localization: English always (the default), then only the client's own language
Localization\localization.lua
Localization\localization.cn.lua    [AllowLoadTextLocale zhCN]
Localization\localization.de.lua    [AllowLoadTextLocale deDE]
Localization\localization.es.lua    [AllowLoadTextLocale esES]
Localization\localization.fr.lua    [AllowLoadTextLocale frFR]
Localization\localization.ko.lua    [AllowLoadTextLocale koKR]
Localization\localization.tw.lua    [AllowLoadTextLocale zhTW]

